{"unit_id":"tag:048Y:statement","translation":"在定义<REF_0001>的情形下，设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>是集合（set）意义下<MATH_0004>-不变的（invariant），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005>是约化的（reduced），且\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006>是局部分离的（locally separated），底为<MATH_0007>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>-不变的（invariant）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变的"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化的"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定态射。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"集合意义下的不变性。"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变的","context":"集合意义下及原关系意义下的不变性。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化的","context":"关系空间的约化性质。"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的","context":"目标相对于底的性质；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:048Y:proof","translation":"考虑等化子（equalizer）\n<MATH_0001>\n这个代数空间（algebraic space）。由假设（3），<MATH_0002>是浸入（immersion）。由假设（1），<MATH_0003>是满射的（surjective）。这蕴含<MATH_0004>是双射的（bijective）闭浸入（closed immersion）（使用《概形（Schemes）》引理<REF_0001>），再由假设（2）可得<MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射的"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"两个复合态射的等化子。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"等化子空间。"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"等化子到关系空间的浸入。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"集合不变性给出的满射。"},{"source_term":"bijective","target_term":"双射的","context":"闭浸入在点集上为双射。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"双射的闭浸入。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"被引用章节；译名待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:048Z:statement","translation":"存在约化的（reduced）、拟分离的（quasi-separated）代数空间（algebraic spaces）<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>以及一对（pair）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003>，它们在所有<MATH_0004>-值点（valued points）上相同，却不相等。为得到一个例子，取<MATH_0005>及\n<MATH_0006>\n后者是《代数空间》例<REF_0001>中的代数空间（algebraic space）。两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0007>来自两个映射（maps）<MATH_0008>和<MATH_0009>，它们从<MATH_0010>到<MATH_0011>。在泛点（generic point）上，这两个映射（maps）相同，因为在开部分（open part）<MATH_0012>，它属于空间（space）<MATH_0013>，函数（functions）<MATH_0014>与<MATH_0015>相等。在闭点（closed point）上，映射（maps）显然也相同。此外，<MATH_0016>也成立。这说明，引理<REF_0002>中的假设（3）若替换为<MATH_0017>是拟分离的（quasi-separated），引理就不成立。具体而言，考虑图表（diagram）\n<MATH_0018>\n则复合（composition）<MATH_0019>。因此，可以令<MATH_0020>、<MATH_0021>、<MATH_0022>、<MATH_0023>、<MATH_0024>，得到一个集合（set）意义下不变（invariant）的态射（morphism）的例子，而它并非不变的（invariant）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化的"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"valued points","target_term":"值点"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"generic point","target_term":"泛点"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"open part","target_term":"开部分"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"functions","target_term":"函数"},{"source_term":"closed point","target_term":"闭点"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图表"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"reduced","target_