{"unit_id":"tag:048M:prose-0008","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n上面的例子很有启发性，因为映射（map）<MATH_0001>甚至区分（separates）轨道（orbits）。它说明，在代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）中，实在存在太多集合（set）意义下不变（invariant）的态射（morphisms）。接下来，我们定义<MATH_0002>为集合论的（set-theoretic）等价关系（equivalence relation）的含义，同时记住，为使定义正确运作，需要允许域（field）扩张（extensions）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"separates","target_term":"区分"},{"source_term":"orbits","target_term":"轨道"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set-theoretic","target_term":"集合论的"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"上例中的映射。"},{"source_term":"separates","target_term":"区分","context":"区分轨道。"},{"source_term":"orbits","target_term":"轨道","context":"上例中的轨道。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"所讨论范畴的对象。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"代数空间范畴。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"set-theoretically 的核心分解。"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变","context":"集合意义下的不变性。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"集合意义下不变的态射。"},{"source_term":"set-theoretic","target_term":"集合论的","context":"下一定义的等价关系限定。"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系","context":"下一定义的主题。"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"允许扩张的域。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"定义需要允许的域扩张；词表尚未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
